# Pricing App

Backend application developed in **Java with Spring Boot**, following a **Hexagonal Architecture (Ports & Adapters).
The purpose of this application is to retrieve product prices based on **application date, product ID, and brand ID**,
always returning the valid price with the **highest priority**.

## Architecture

The project is structured using **Hexagonal Architecture**, clearly separating responsibilities into:

- REST Controllers (input layer)
- Domain (business logic)
- Input and Output Ports
- Infrastructure (persistence, repositories, mappers)

This architecture provides:
- Low coupling
- High testability
- Easy replacement of infrastructure components

## Technologies Used

- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- MyBatis
- Lombok
- Maven
- Relational Database (H2 / MySQL)

